{
    "name": "淘金與溜槽",
    "category": "tfg:craftsmanship",
    "icon": "tfc:pan/empty",
    "pages": [
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "panning",
            "title": "淘金",
            "text": "$(thing)淘金$()是在河流等水道中搜尋，以取得某些原生礦石礦粉的方法。$(br2)淘金需要$(t:#tfc:ore_deposits)$(6)礦床$()，分布在湖泊和河流底部的礫石區。$(br2)要開始淘金，需要一個$(item)空淘盤$()。"
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:knapping_recipe",
            "recipe": "tfc:clay_knapping/pan",
            "text": "黏土可以如上圖所示$(l:craftsmanship/pottery)塑形$()成淘盤。"
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:heat_recipe",
            "recipe": "tfc:heating/ceramic_pan",
            "text": "淘盤$(thing)塑形$()後，需要$(l:game_mechanics/heating)燒製$()成$(thing)陶瓷淘盤$()。$(br2)接著要找到$(t:#tfc:ore_deposits)$(6)礦床$()，礦床的礦石有幾種：原生銅、原生銀、原生金和錫石。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "X"
                    ],
                    [
                        "0"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "X": "#tfc:ore_deposits"
                }
            },
            "name": "礦床範例",
            "text": "礫石中的礦床。",
            "enable_visualize": false
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "現在可以開始淘金了！$(br2)$(bold)1.$() 手持淘盤對礦床方塊按 $(item)$(k:key.use)$()。$(br2)$(bold)2.$() 站在水中手持淘盤，按住 $(item)$(k:key.use)$() 即開始淘金。$(br2)$(bold)3.$() 過一會兒，運氣好的話，物品欄中會出現一些礦粉。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "images": [
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/panning.png"
            ],
            "border": true
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "anchor": "sluice",
            "title": "溜槽",
            "item": "tag:tfc:sluices",
            "text": "$(thing)溜槽$()能自動處理$(thing)礦床$()，產物與$(l:craftsmanship/panning#panning)淘金$()相同，機率還稍高一些。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "溜槽放置後佔兩格。水必須從溜槽頂部流入、底部流出才能運作；看到水流過溜槽，就表示正在運作。流進溜槽的水必須是水流的最後一格，且溜槽底部下方必須有一格空方塊讓水流入。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "images": [
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/sluice_cross.png"
            ],
            "text": "水流配置正確的溜槽。",
            "border": true
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "使用時，把礦床物品丟進水流，讓水把它們沖進溜槽。物品會出現在溜槽上，一段時間後，處理過的產物有機率從底部吐出。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:image",
            "images": [
                "tfc:textures/gui/book/tutorial/sluice_in_use.png"
            ],
            "text": "裡面有礦床物品、正在運作的溜槽。",
            "border": true
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "淘金和溜槽可能產出幾種產物：$(thing)礦粉$()、$(thing)小堆礦粉$()、$(thing)碎石$()和$(thing)寶石$()。$(br)在$(emi)中查看礦床，即可得知取得各種掉落物的機率。",
            "title": "預期產物"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:relations",
            "title": "延伸閱讀",
            "anchor": "relations",
            "entries": [
                "tfg:the_world/geology",
                "tfg:craftsmanship/sticks_and_stones",
                "tfg:craftsmanship/pottery",
                "tfg:craftsmanship/metallurgy"
            ]
        }
    ],
    "read_by_default": true,
    "sortnum": 15,
    "extra_recipe_mappings": {
        "tag:tfc:ore_deposits": 0,
        "tfc:ceramic/unfired_pan": 1,
        "tfc:pan/empty": 2,
        "tfc:pan/filled": 4,
        "tag:tfc:sluices": 6
    }
}